From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:55:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] hyperion.ng: feed the Kodi picture to hyperiond

Since the Amlogic grabber is gone, hyperiond has no input for the
Kodi picture. The grabber also showed only the video layer, never
the Kodi menus or the on-screen display.
---
 .../addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt  |   1 +
 .../addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk     |   8 +
 .../service/hyperion.ng/source/default.py     | 213 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../resource.language.en_gb/strings.po        |  33 +++
 .../hyperion.ng/source/resources/settings.xml |  21 ++
 5 files changed, 274 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/source/resources/language/resource.language.en_gb/strings.po
 create mode 100644 projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/source/resources/settings.xml

